{"page":104,"verses":[{"verse_key":"4:163","surah":4,"ayah":163,"ar_uthmani":"۞ إِنَّآ أَوْحَيْنَآ إِلَيْكَ كَمَآ أَوْحَيْنَآ إِلَىٰ نُوحٍ وَٱلنَّبِيِّـۧنَ مِنۢ بَعْدِهِۦ ۚ وَأَوْحَيْنَآ إِلَىٰٓ إِبْرَٰهِيمَ وَإِسْمَـٰعِيلَ وَإِسْحَـٰقَ وَيَعْقُوبَ وَٱلْأَسْبَاطِ وَعِيسَىٰ وَأَيُّوبَ وَيُونُسَ وَهَـٰرُونَ وَسُلَيْمَـٰنَ ۚ وَءَاتَيْنَا دَاوُۥدَ زَبُورًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We have sent revelation to you [Prophet] as We did to Noah and the prophets after him, to Abraham, Ishmael, Isaac, Jacob, and the Tribes, to Jesus, Job, Jonah, Aaron, and Solomon- to David We gave the book [of Psalms]-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ إِنَّآ","en_gloss":"Indeed, We","transliteration":"innā","verse_key":"4:163"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَوْحَيْنَآ","en_gloss":"have revealed","transliteration":"awḥaynā","verse_key":"4:163"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِلَيْكَ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ilayka","verse_key":"4:163"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كَمَآ","en_gloss":"as","transliteration":"kamā","verse_key":"4:163"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَوْحَيْنَآ","en_gloss":"We revealed","transliteration":"awḥaynā","verse_key":"4:163"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"4:163"},{"pos":7,"ar":"نُوحٍۢ","en_gloss":"Nuh","transliteration":"nūḥin","verse_key":"4:163"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَٱلنَّبِيِّـۧنَ","en_gloss":"and the Prophets","transliteration":"wal-nabiyīna","verse_key":"4:163"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِنۢ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"4:163"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بَعْدِهِۦ ۚ","en_gloss":"after him","transliteration":"baʿdihi","verse_key":"4:163"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَأَوْحَيْنَآ","en_gloss":"and We revealed","transliteration":"wa-awḥaynā","verse_key":"4:163"},{"pos":12,"ar":"إِلَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"4:163"},{"pos":13,"ar":"إِبْرَٰهِيمَ","en_gloss":"Ibrahim","transliteration":"ib'rāhīma","verse_key":"4:163"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَإِسْمَـٰعِيلَ","en_gloss":"and Ishmael","transliteration":"wa-is'māʿīla","verse_key":"4:163"},{"pos":15,"ar